+| 52 · L47 | Han: generic share increased 23 percentage points after 2024 inhaler cuts | CONFIRMED with class and design qualification | DOI [10.1377/hlthaff.2025.01309](https://doi.org/10.1377/hlthaff.2025.01309), [publisher abstract](https://www.healthaffairs.org/doi/10.1377/hlthaff.2025.01309), March 2026. This concerns ICS-LABA inhalers and an association with price reductions, not every inhaler or a general experiment proving cap removal's effect. |
